{"seq":1,"slug":"backpressure-strategies","title":"背压策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/functional-reactive-programming/patterns/backpressure-strategies","wordCount":485,"readingTime":2,"html":"<h1 id=\"背压策略\">背压策略</h1><p>背压（Backpressure）是响应式系统中处理<strong>生产者速率 &gt; 消费者速率</strong>这一根本矛盾的机制集合。选错背压策略会导致内存溢出（无限缓冲）、数据丢失（激进丢弃）或延迟堆积（阻塞等待）。正确的策略选择取决于数据的<strong>可丢弃性</strong>和<strong>时效性</strong>要求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>背压的根本问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"生产者 (1000 items/sec) → [???] → 消费者 (100 items/sec)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>生产者 (1000 items/sec) → [???] → 消费者 (100 items/sec)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>五种策略及其核心取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>内存</th>\n<th>数据完整性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Buffer</strong></td>\n<td>缓冲所有数据</td>\n<td>高（可能 OOM）</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>短暂突发，数据不可丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Drop</strong></td>\n<td>丢弃最新数据（缓冲满后）</td>\n<td>有界</td>\n<td>有损失</td>\n<td>可重试的非关键事件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Latest</strong></td>\n<td>只保留最新值，丢弃旧值</td>\n<td>最低（O(1)）</td>\n<td>只要最新</td>\n<td>UI 状态更新、传感器数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Request-based</strong></td>\n<td>Subscriber 主动拉取，协作流控</td>\n<td>精确控制</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>数据库游标、文件读取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Rate-limit</strong></td>\n<td>在源头限速（节流/防抖）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n<td>API 调用、用户输入</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BP[背压场景] --&gt; Q{数据可丢弃?}&#10;    Q --&gt; |否| BUF[Buffer策略\\n完整保留]&#10;    Q --&gt; |是| T{时效性要求?}&#10;    T --&gt; |只要最新| LAT[Latest策略\\n只保最新]&#10;    T --&gt; |可丢旧值| DROP[Drop策略\\n有界丢弃]&#10;    BUF --&gt; R{是否协作?}&#10;    R --&gt; |是| REQ[Request-based\\n协作拉取]&#10;    R --&gt; |否| BUF2[纯缓冲\\n需监控]\">graph TD\n    BP[背压场景] --&gt; Q{数据可丢弃?}\n    Q --&gt; |否| BUF[Buffer策略\\n完整保留]\n    Q --&gt; |是| T{时效性要求?}\n    T --&gt; |只要最新| LAT[Latest策略\\n只保最新]\n    T --&gt; |可丢旧值| DROP[Drop策略\\n有界丢弃]\n    BUF --&gt; R{是否协作?}\n    R --&gt; |是| REQ[Request-based\\n协作拉取]\n    R --&gt; |否| BUF2[纯缓冲\\n需监控]</pre><h2 id=\"buffer-策略\">Buffer 策略</h2><p>Buffer 是最简单但最危险的策略：无界缓冲最终导致 OOM。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// Reactor: 有界 Buffer（缓冲满后报错）&#10;Flux&lt;Integer&gt; buffered = Flux.range(1, 1000)&#10;    .onBackpressureBuffer(100)  // 缓冲最多 100 个，超出 ERROR&#10;    .onBackpressureBuffer(&#10;        100,&#10;        dropped -&gt; log.warn(&quot;丢弃: {}&quot;, dropped),&#10;        BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_OLDEST  // 满后丢弃最旧的&#10;    );&#10;&#10;// 不同溢出策略&#10;BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_OLDEST  // 丢弃缓冲中最旧的&#10;BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_LATEST  // 丢弃新到的&#10;BufferOverflowStrategy.ERROR        // 发出 onError（默认）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Reactor: 有界 Buffer（缓冲满后报错）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Flux&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> buffered </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Flux.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBackpressureBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 缓冲最多 100 个，超出 ERROR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onBackpressureBuffer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        dropped </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"丢弃: {}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, dropped),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_OLDEST  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 满后丢弃最旧的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不同溢出策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_OLDEST  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 丢弃缓冲中最旧的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BufferOverflowStrategy.DROP_LATEST  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 丢弃新到的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">BufferOverflowStrategy.ERROR        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 发出 onError（默认）</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// RxJS: bufferTime / bufferCount&#10;import { bufferTime, bufferCount, bufferWhen } from &#39;rxjs/operators&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 每秒收集一批&#10;source$.pipe(bufferTime(1000)).subscribe((batch) =&gt; processBatch(batch));&#10;&#10;// 每 10 个收集一批&#10;source$.pipe(bufferCount(10)).subscribe((batch) =&gt; processBatch(batch));&#10;&#10;// 动态 window&#10;source$.pipe(bufferWhen(() =&gt; interval(Math.random() * 2000))).subscribe((batch) =&gt; processBatch(batch));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// RxJS: bufferTime / bufferCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { bufferTime, bufferCount, bufferWhen } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'rxjs/operators'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每秒收集一批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bufferTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 每 10 个收集一批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bufferCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">subscribe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(batch));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态 window</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">source$.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pipe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">bufferWhen</span><span style=\"color:#24